--[[
        INTERMINABLE ROOMS -- the entities of the Interminable Rooms wiki, in DOORS

            _G.Entity = "A-60"
            loadstring(game:HttpGet("https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bonellocristian78-lab/Gradish-Mode/claude/sei-qui-con-noi-ye4k62/InterminableRooms"))()

        Every page of the wiki's Entities category (events, scrapped and removed ones too): its face (its GIF moving,
        its faces in turn, like A-60's), its colour in its light, its sounds (spawn, ambience near and far, jumpscare,
        despawn, scream, locker breaking...) and what the wiki says it does:

            runners        from the lobby (the oldest room loaded) to your room, killing whoever is not hidden;
                           rebounds, faster each time; idling, sinking, going beyond, back to the lobby, fake despawns;
                           from ahead (A-200), from behind, from your room backwards (A-5, E-144)
            checkers       to the lockers or the beds and tables of your room, one by one: hidden there, you die
            breakers       the hiding places it breaks or locks are gone (A-245, A-244, V-100)
            wanderers      the E-1 family, the Boots, M-120: around your room, kicking, charging, shooting, exploding
            chasers, hoppers, the ones that circle you (V-400), drop from the ceiling (V-247), cross the room from a
            wall (E-42), stand screaming (A-258), guard the door (A-404, E-0.6), heal you (E-50), summon others
            (A-300, X-300, E-300), sit on your screen until clicked (E-0, MT-0), want you still (Trollface-90), order
            you to hide or not (XX-200), the Signardos with their notes...

        Its name as on the wiki ("A-60", "X-60", "SCARY-60", "E-1", "Tiny Timbs Tony"), in any case, with or without
        the dash; a wrong one prints the nearest names. Run it again for another: they can be about together.
        Its files are downloaded once into the executor's folder, then read from there: only you see and hear it.
        The jumpscare, the death screen with the wiki's tips. Outside DOORS it comes down a straight line at you.

        Optional, before the loadstring:
            _G.InterminableRooms = { Volume = 1, Delay = 2.5, Kick = true }
            (Kick = false: the ones that kick you out of the game kill you instead)
]]

local Players = game:GetService("Players")
local RunService = game:GetService("RunService")
local TweenService = game:GetService("TweenService")
local Lighting = game:GetService("Lighting")
local SoundService = game:GetService("SoundService")
local ReplicatedStorage = game:GetService("ReplicatedStorage")
local LocalPlayer = Players.LocalPlayer

local CONFIG = {
	Entity = "A-60",
	Volume = 1,
	Delay = 2.5, -- seconds between a runner's spawn sound and it setting off
	Kick = true, -- the ones that kick you out of the game do (false: they kill you)
	MaxSpeed = 1000, -- studs a second (the fastest are faster than you can see)
	Folder = "InterminableRooms",
	AssetsUrl = "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bonellocristian78-lab/Gradish-Mode/claude/sei-qui-con-noi-ye4k62/assets/ir/",
}
local override = _G.InterminableRooms
_G.InterminableRooms = nil
if type(override) == "table" then
	for k, v in pairs(override) do CONFIG[k] = v end
end
for key, value in pairs(_G) do -- _G.Entity (any capitals)
	if type(key) == "string" and key:lower() == "entity" and value ~= nil then
		CONFIG.Entity, _G[key] = tostring(value), nil
	end
end

